/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Archimedean.Cuboctahedron.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Archimedean.Cuboctahedron.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `archimedeanCuboctahedron_nu_reps_list`. -/
